BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Pavements
DTSTART:20250530T230000Z
DTEND:20250531T013000Z
DTSTAMP:20250530T230000Z
UID:X78wKa0lhQ
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 128 mins (2h08m)\n\nAlex Ross Perry surveys the embl
 ematic 1990s US indie rock band in typically idiosyncratic style: part-doc
 umentary\, part-biopic\, part-stage musical—but all Pavement. May 30\, 7
 :00 pm Screening - Pavement music video director Lance Bangs and producer 
 Gabe Spierer scheduled to attend for a post-film Q&A. Also\, win a sweet P
 avement record on vinyl from Hex Enduction via trivia\, and the first 20 c
 ustomers in the door will receive $5 gift cards to Royal Records!\n\nhttps
 ://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/pavements
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
