BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Brokeback Mountain
DTSTART:20250624T020000Z
DTEND:20250624T043500Z
DTSTAMP:20250624T020000Z
UID:KecBedr52y
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 134 mins (2h14m)\n\n“I wish I knew how to quit you
 .” Celebrate 20 years of Brokeback Mountain with SIFF. Ang Lee’s haunt
 ing\, tender story of forbidden love between two cowboys brought to life b
 y unforgettable performances from Heath Ledger and Jake Gyllenhaal\, was n
 othing short of revolutionary. A turning point for queer cinema and a land
 mark in American film\, Brokeback Mountain continues to move and challenge
  audiences two decades later. See it on the big screen while you can.\n\nh
 ttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/brokeback-mountain
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Know Your Place
DTSTART:20250706T020000Z
DTEND:20250706T042000Z
DTSTAMP:20250706T020000Z
UID:x5AjVwWeUZ
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 118 mins (1h58m)\n\nSeattle’s issues with gentrifi
 cation and its impact on our East African community are explored as two te
 enage boys navigate the city to deliver a crucial and time-sensitive packa
 ge to a friend. 2022 Seattle International Film Festival Golden Space Need
 le Award - Best Film. Director Zia Mohajerjasbi scheduled to attend for p
 ost-film Q&A.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/know-your-place
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
